The study of properties about a ${fref("/01-programming-language-theory/02-concepts/formal-system.td")} (e.g., ${fref("/01-programming-language-theory/02-concepts/sound.td")}ness, ${fref("/01-programming-language-theory/02-concepts/completeness.td")}, termination), using external reasoning to prove facts about the system itself.
